OL,3,GNEWSAPilot suffers life-threatening
OL,4,Ainjuries in crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FA pilot has suffered potentially
OL,7,Flife-changing injuries following a
OL,8,Fplane crash.
OL,10,FHampshire Police said it was called at
OL,11,F17:45 BST on Sunday after reports of a
OL,12,Fcrash at Popham Airfield involving a
OL,13,Fsingle light aircraft, which had
OL,14,Foverturned.
OL,16,FIt said the pilot, a 62-year-old man,
OL,17,Fwas taken to hospital with "serious and
OL,18,Fpotentially life-threatening and
OL,19,Flife-changing injuries".
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
